# Workspace lockfiles. This is an npm-workspaces monorepo (root package.json
# "workspaces": web, app, cloud/server, cloud/web) and the ROOT
# package-lock.json already contains every workspace's dependency tree — every
# `npm ci`, in CI and in both Dockerfiles, runs from the root and reads only
# that one.
#
# A lockfile committed inside a workspace is therefore never consulted, but it
# IS what Dependabot updates: it bumps `web/package.json` + `web/package-lock.json`
# and leaves the root lock untouched, so package.json and the root lock disagree
# and `npm ci` fails before any code runs. Seven security PRs (#206-#212) all
# failed that way, including a postcss patch bump — the dependency changes were
# fine, the lockfiles were not.
/*/package-lock.json
/cloud/*/package-lock.json
